{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "109f81110ca0cc7c1659c5eb552c2ae3333f7fddcd02d84ed954d6c7c92d1e71", "ja": "（もうすぐ、フラワーパレードが始まる。かなりの\n人出があるみたいだけど、朋花は大丈夫かな……）", "zh": "（百花游行马上就要开始了。\n好像来了相当多人，朋花没问题吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d9d3be2108b80859d4fd4508ccd9ae19b951ff02872cb7f9d5554031de6e92dd", "ja": "朋花、もうすぐ出番だけど、緊張してないか？\n今のうちに、何か飲んでおくか？", "zh": "朋花，马上就要出场了，你不会紧张吗？\n要不要趁现在喝点东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "86202a6a4b4e094c0d9e6bbd810b570e02c30c9024666c372ee1f4712395601b", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。\n心配しなくても、私なら大丈夫ですよ～。", "zh": "谢谢你～\n不需要担心，我没问题～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "8bd48e2bf4111751b3d0942a53dcafdafef18970dfc332da9e2f222670e6d180", "ja": "控え室に飾られていたお花がとても綺麗で、\nリラックスできましたから～。", "zh": "装饰在准备室里的花非常美丽，\n让我的心情很放松～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1004_p", "source_sha256": "00cfeba9c8baf591b89fbdc46302d5b2b54865c3cdab68b14f5d43a304a7773c", "ja": "そうか、ならいいんだけど……。\n何か気になることがあったら、すぐに言ってくれ！", "zh": "这样啊，那就好……\n只要有任何在意的地方，都马上告诉我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "18049ded7a2093324cb976f43e1e2f8db7417a7727eb67653ad79627a44c31e5", "ja": "そうですか？　では、ひとつ……\nすこしだけ、目を閉じていてくれませんか～？", "zh": "是吗？那么，确实有一件事……\n你可以稍微闭上眼睛一下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "09b0747e734ea1e5747220d1f32e85c8512cf0aae5c50f5653ba3c9dbb53d93f", "ja": "いいですか？　{$P$}さん。\n私が良いと言うまで、開けてはいけませんよ～。", "zh": "听好啰，{$P$}先生，\n在我说好之前不可以张开眼睛喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bf809e97a66466e1694eb40c070ddcf723266e6634c72519c3e469303d30d79f", "ja": "え……わ、わかった。\n……これでいいのか？", "zh": "咦……我、我知道了。\n……这样就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "d49f6c061408f13a47f921551ddbdb170cf417919c95af400b43ba17bbffd950", "ja": "うふふっ、まだですからね～。\n5、4、3、2、1、……0。", "zh": "呵呵，还没好喔～\n5、4、3、2、1……0。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1009_null", "source_sha256": "d6b4481cde761dec411159ddcb2e539f53a7db2762823e67c2f1e6a68217ba8c", "ja": "パサ……", "zh": "（放下……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "d43f7af6f8e1fc51f7de8184531e85c4159280a857773686f54bff468b96cab8", "ja": "はい、{$P$}さん。\n目を開けても、かまいませんよ～？", "zh": "好了，{$P$}先生。\n可以张开眼睛了喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1011_p", "source_sha256": "80e26be4de4ee57d8551b4c4e850a217235cd17d2cca32e419c03ad8fcbe35f0", "ja": "ええと……あれ？\nこんなところに、チューリップが……？", "zh": "呃……咦？\n这里怎么有郁金香……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "f31870c5943def7479c18ffd8025e55d7eba976a90ceb34ea2caa0f35ccd0345", "ja": "ええ、そうですよ～。\n{$P$}さんに、一輪差し上げます～。", "zh": "是的，没错喔～\n{$P$}先生，这朵郁金香送你～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1013_p", "source_sha256": "36bfde43d2d9ddcddf8b5cb373909664a53bcfb527d12b5d99e7cd08967bfd53", "ja": "あ、ありがとう。\nけど、どうしてこんなところにチューリップが？", "zh": "谢、谢谢你。\n不过，为什么这里会有郁金香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "09b8cdd06b09461909ae2e230044509b91b305a1e3b2e0e997d7915ae30fe2bc", "ja": "控え室のお花が綺麗だったので、本番まで\nお供をしてもらおうと思って、持ってきたんです～。", "zh": "因为准备室里的花很漂亮，我想在正式上场前\n让这些花陪在身边，就带过来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "5dbaeae60db1ab71a23e24164ddf1e76df647d502b80cc03fdbc991025c2de45", "ja": "品種にもよりますが、チューリップの香りには\n気持ちを落ち着かせる効果が多いそうですよ～。", "zh": "虽然还是要看品种，但郁金香的香味好像\n大都有让人放松心情的效果喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "03ec8fc7faa59c832db08c25ce265bf04fe7449d5ee0b49f702428d814aec023", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、ご存知でしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b1e243d63c26574e58217022c519f6f1268d36ad72424714b3c629584423b075", "ja": "いや……。ごめん、それは知らなかった……。", "zh": "不……抱歉，我不知道这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "7bf9ea51e4794c933d89d789d2defa78532cfe1ae61a54856f03d7cf35562ded", "ja": "うふふ、かまいませんよ～。\n素直なのは、良いことです～。", "zh": "呵呵，没关系喔～\n能坦率承认是很好的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "eef57cc8a23b86b00abd33d334f81ebde9f118a0756019a0653b773ed9fd8176", "ja": "ですから、私は大丈夫なんです～。今日は\nお花たちが味方ですから、何も心配いりません～。", "zh": "所以啰，我没问题的～\n今天有花儿们当我的同伴，不需要担心任何事～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1022_p", "source_sha256": "edfa22c49c278124c2536ccc160a0996b698d8e0ed0c4668cd9d5e9536d47891", "ja": "花が味方か……確かにそうだな。\n朋花が言うなら、間違いない。", "zh": "有花当同伴吗……你说得对。\n既然朋花这么说了，肯定没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "985b43bdb52010a2e1c0c2c6d77970e1d213623dcd9802cafb6f36c228707b58", "ja": "ええ、もちろん。\n……そろそろ、パレードが始まりますね～。", "zh": "是的，当然没错。\n……游行差不多要开始了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "9a7dd253b6244df4720fc05403bc8424dc9349efc06964b6f28a5b476c823a49", "ja": "では{$P$}さん、いってきます。\n聖母の姿、ちゃんと目に焼き付けるんですよ～？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生，我上场了。\n你要睁大眼睛看清楚圣母的样子喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ba81e4dfe0e965a273f82c9763056fb3b9cae7d075a6779320bb7e41ed58ca1c", "ja": "（そして、パレードが始まった。大歓声の中、\n朋花は集まった全ての人に届くよう、笑顔で手を振る）", "zh": "（游行随后开始，朋花在热烈的欢呼声中露出笑容，\n朝每一位聚集在这里的人挥手。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0114_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5e039bef274aee896297ff6e02a642ee85e160a26495ee451065fca63f45a6c8", "ja": "（その姿は、花よりも花のような……\nとても聖母らしい、幸福なパレードになった）", "zh": "（她的模样胜似花朵……\n这是一场非常有圣母风范的幸福游行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
